			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Add backup files for Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json\n\nCreate backup copies of the current Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json configuration files to preserve the existing Mountain binary configuration, including the Tauri identifier, productName, feature flags, and build settings.",
